<div class="features">
  <header class="features__header">
    <h1 class="features__title">What Tagout does</h1>
    <p class="features__subtitle">What you can use today, and what we're building next.</p>
  </header>

  <section class="features__section">
    <h2 class="features__heading">Current features</h2>
    <div class="features__grid">
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Colorado draw stats</h3>
        <p>Preference points, choice draws, applicants, success and odds for Elk, Deer, Pronghorn and Bear, by hunt code.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Filters</h3>
        <p>Narrow by species, sex, method, season, unit, residency and minimum odds, and highlight your own point level.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Weighted draw odds</h3>
        <p>For Moose, Mountain Goat and Rocky Mountain Bighorn, see projected odds by weighted points alongside what actually happened in the draw.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Your profile</h3>
        <p>Save your residency and preference points so your home screen links straight to the odds that matter to you.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Feedback</h3>
        <p>Tell us what's missing from the feedback button in the corner of the dashboard.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="features__section">
    <h2 class="features__heading">Coming soon</h2>
    <div class="features__grid">
      <div class="card">
        <h3>More states</h3>
        <p>Draw data beyond Colorado, starting with the other Western big game states.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Preference point tracker</h3>
        <p>Track your points over time and see which hunts you're closing in on.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Deadline &amp; results notifications</h3>
        <p>Reminders for application deadlines and draw result dates. You can opt in from your profile today.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>
